# Copy this file to cookie.txt and fill in your own cookies exported from bilibili.com.
# Two formats are accepted:
#
# 1) Single-line header format (recommended, easy to copy from browser DevTools):
buvid3=xxxxxxxx; buvid4=xxxxxxxx; SESSDATA=xxxxxxxx; bili_jct=xxxxxxxx; DedeUserID=123456
#
# 2) Netscape cookies.txt format (exported via a browser extension):
# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# .bilibili.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	0	SESSDATA	xxxxxxxx
#
# Notes:
# - SESSDATA is required for search / uploader discovery (space API) and member-only content.
# - The tool checks login state at startup and warns when SESSDATA expires (stale cookies make
#   space APIs fail with a misleading -352 risk-control error).
# - NEVER commit your real cookie.txt. It is a login credential.
